Ready to sharpen your mind, master mental math, memorize world flags, and conquer chemistry?

iFunSchool is your ultimate brain training playground, combining 15 diverse games into one exhilarating educational experience. Whether you want to polish your quick arithmetic, learn every single flag of the world, or challenge yourself on the periodic table, iFunSchool makes daily learning genuinely fun, addictive, and rewarding!

15 EXCITING GAME TYPES

Train across 4 distinct learning disciplines:
• MATHEMATICS: Addition, Subtraction, Multiplication, Division, Order of Operations, Equations, Sequences & Series, plus 3 intense Mental Math modes!
• GEOGRAPHY: World Flags – learn every sovereign country flag on the planet!
• CHEMISTRY: Chemical Elements – master symbols and element names from the periodic table!
• PERCEPTION & MEMORY: Visual Memory – recall shapes, patterns, and vibrant color sequences!

SMART LEARNING & ERROR CORRECTION

• VISUAL PROGRESS TRACKER: Track your mastery step-by-step. See exactly which flags, elements, and math operations you have mastered and which ones need more practice!
• ADAPTIVE REPETITION: Questions are randomized, but our smart algorithm prioritizes items you previously got wrong until you conquer them. It's the most effective way to memorize all flags and math facts!

DAILY PROGRESS & STREAKS

• Make brain training a daily habit! Track your daily activity, maintain your streak, and watch your speed, accuracy, and confidence skyrocket day after day.

 LEVELS OF DIFFICULTY

Every game offers progressive challenge levels:
1. Beginner – Gentle introduction, ideal for younger learners.
2. Easy – Building core speed and confidence.
3. Medium – Balanced test of knowledge and quick thinking.
4. Hard – Fast-paced and demanding.
5. Ultimate – True test of skill with larger question sets and higher ranges.
6. GODLIKE – Extreme mode for true geniuses! Ultra-hard questions that push your intellect to its absolute limits.

CLEVER RANDOMIZED QUESTIONS

No two games are ever the same! Questions are procedurally generated, and answer choices are carefully crafted to be temptingly close to the correct answer – testing real mastery, not lucky guesses!

STARS & PROGRESSION

Earn up to 4 standard stars based on your score:
• 32%+ correct: 1 Star
• 50%+ correct: 2 Stars
• 75%+ correct: 3 Stars
• 90%+ correct: 4 Stars
• 100% PERFECT GAME: 4 Stars PLUS an elite GOLD STAR!
Collect stars to unlock higher tiers across all game types.


